# Committed fakes. Not credentials, and not a place to put one.
#
# Semgrep drops a finding only when every provider-shaped token on the
# matched line is in this file. GitHub secret scanning ignores the paths in
# secret_scanning.yml, which are the only places these values are allowed
# to live. Add a value here in the same change that introduces it.

# Login timing dummy. Same verify cost when the account has no password.
$2y$13$A5.u1234567890123456789012345678901234567890123456789

# PHP's published password_verify test vector. Same verify cost for a missing WordPress account.
